  "title": "PSE&G Urges Customers to Prepare for Dangerous Heat and the Possibility of Isolated Thunderstorms and Wind",
  "summary": "The heat index is expected to climb above 100 degrees and isolated thunderstorms with potentially high winds are possible later this afternoon, this evening and throughout the weekend. PSE&G is encouraging customers to take steps now to stay safe and be prepared in case severe weather causes scattered power outages.",
